# Iron's Spells in Life 1 (issue #104, life/mortal_spells.js, ttl-portals SpellManaMixin + TensuraIronCastMixin).
# The Tensura bridge pays spells from magicules (50 x the mana cost); a Life 1 Human holds 50-70, so every spellbook cast
# in the Mortal Realm used to fail with "Not enough mana". In the Mortal dimensions Iron's now spends its own mana; outside
# them the bridge is untouched. Blood and eldritch stay refused there (O-N1, mortal_banned.toml spell_schools).
# `ttl spells ...` and `ttl stash ... spell` print "ttl: ..." when something does not hold (a test-all failure).
ttlbot spawn TtlBotSpell
@sleep 4
execute as TtlBotSpell run ttl reset TtlBotSpell
@sleep 2
ttl spells TtlBotSpell
ttl racelock TtlBotSpell expect tensura:human
# ---- the Mortal Realm: Iron's own mana, no magicule conversion ----
ttl spells TtlBotSpell mana 100
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cost irons_spellbooks:firebolt plain
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cancast irons_spellbooks:firebolt yes
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cancast irons_spellbooks:heal yes
# A real cast (heal: instant, on itself) goes off on the next tick and costs its plain mana, not a single magicule.
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cast irons_spellbooks:heal yes
@sleep 1
ttl spells TtlBotSpell spent
# Without the mana it is still refused, as anywhere in Iron's.
ttl spells TtlBotSpell mana 0
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cancast irons_spellbooks:firebolt no
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cast irons_spellbooks:heal no
# The necromancer's and the abyss's schools stay vetoed in the Mortal dimensions; the others are free.
ttl stash TtlBotSpell spell irons_spellbooks:blood yes
ttl stash TtlBotSpell spell irons_spellbooks:eldritch yes
ttl stash TtlBotSpell spell irons_spellbooks:fire no
ttl stash TtlBotSpell spell irons_spellbooks:holy no
# A Life 1 body that does hold the magicules still pays in Iron's mana there: the bridge's cast handler is skipped too.
tensura edit stat TtlBotSpell magicule max set 100000
tensura edit stat TtlBotSpell magicule current set 100000
clearCooldowns player TtlBotSpell
ttl spells TtlBotSpell mana 100
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cast irons_spellbooks:heal yes
@sleep 1
ttl spells TtlBotSpell spent
tensura edit stat TtlBotSpell magicule max set 50
tensura edit stat TtlBotSpell magicule current set 50
# A summon spell works too, even inside Wayfarer's Rest's safe-spawn square (life/mortal_spawns.js).
clearCooldowns player TtlBotSpell
ttl spells TtlBotSpell mana 100
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cast irons_spellbooks:summon_vex yes
@sleep 1
ttl spells TtlBotSpell summons 1
execute as TtlBotSpell at @s run kill @e[type=irons_spellbooks:summoned_vex,distance=..32]
# ---- outside the Mortal dimensions the bridge still applies: 50 magicules are not enough for a firebolt ----
# (the Spirit Corridor: not mortal, and life/confine.js leaves a soul there)
execute in ttl:spirit_corridor run tp TtlBotSpell 0.5 65 0.5
@sleep 1
ttl spells TtlBotSpell mana 100
ttl spells TtlBotSpell cancast irons_spellbooks:firebolt no
ttl reset TtlBotSpell
ttlbot remove TtlBotSpell
